1
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:18,220
Saw it on my feed this morning

2
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:22,020
Wedged between the ads and the rain

3
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:24,800
Kid went over the rail at the zoo

4
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:29,120
Like the warning signs were part of the game

5
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:32,320
Sixteen feet of chain-link fence

6
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:35,520
Painted red, impossible to miss

7
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:38,960
And a thousand comments asking why

8
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:42,400
Like none of them ever wanted this

9
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:45,760
But I know that pull —

10
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:49,410
The gorgeous and the terrible

11
00:00:49,410 --> 00:00:52,590
The thing behind the glass

12
00:00:52,590 --> 00:00:56,000
That calls you by your name

13
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,550
Everybody’s got a tiger

14
00:00:58,550 --> 00:01:02,970
Something beautiful that bites

15
00:01:02,970 --> 00:01:05,890
Everybody’s got a railing

16
00:01:05,890 --> 00:01:10,480
And a reason, and a night

17
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:14,090
And I keep climbing, keep on climbing

18
00:01:14,090 --> 00:01:17,750
Like the fence was never there

19
00:01:17,750 --> 00:01:23,960
Don’t you tell me you can’t hear it

20
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:26,590
Purring somewhere

21
00:01:39,590 --> 00:01:42,930
Not two weeks later I caught myself

22
00:01:42,930 --> 00:01:46,930
One leg over a rail of my own

23
00:01:46,930 --> 00:01:50,080
Staring down at something hungry

24
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:53,600
Wearing my face, picking at a bone

25
00:01:53,600 --> 00:01:57,080
And the safe-side crowd’s still talking

26
00:01:57,080 --> 00:02:00,290
Tickets in hand, so sure, so loud

27
00:02:00,290 --> 00:02:03,400
Swearing up and down they’d never —

28
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:07,270
From the dry side of the moat, real proud

29
00:02:07,270 --> 00:02:10,720
Everybody’s got a tiger

30
00:02:10,720 --> 00:02:14,320
Something beautiful that bites

31
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:17,120
Everybody’s got a railing

32
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:21,600
And a reason, and a night

33
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:25,190
And I keep climbing, keep on climbing

34
00:02:25,190 --> 00:02:28,880
Like the fence was never there

35
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:35,090
Don’t you tell me you can’t hear it

36
00:02:35,090 --> 00:02:37,710
Purring somewhere

37
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:53,940
They put the tiger down that evening

38
00:02:53,940 --> 00:02:57,440
Standard procedure, so they said

39
00:02:57,440 --> 00:03:02,080
Something wild did something wild

40
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:05,460
So something wild ends up dead

41
00:03:05,460 --> 00:03:09,230
It was never the tiger’s idea

42
00:03:09,230 --> 00:03:13,110
To build a cage in town...
